UID:09-05-t0-keynote-to-be-announced-wednesday@https://2026.djangocon.us
SUMMARY:Keynote: Django 6: The Most Exciting Release Ever
LOCATION:Sauganash Ballroom
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Karen Tracey\n\nDjango 6.0 has multiple very exciting new features, including:
 
 Template Partials
 Background Tasks Framework
 Content Security Policy
 Modern Email API
 
 In this talk we'll discuss each of these features, illustrating why you may want to start using them as soon as possible. Additionally we'll cover some tips and tools for a smooth upgrade experience. By the end of the talk we believe you'll agree that Django 6.0 has earned the accolade of most exciting Django release ever.
 
URL:https://2026.djangocon.us/talks/keynote-wednesday-django-6-the-most-exciting-release-ever/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
